From db1636639cebb9ad67ee62fe3cf2edc0ad3a622a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:58:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(R4): compile break, diagnostics, trust gaps (static,
 unverified)

- X1: update m3 stream-decoder test to the sealed result type; add exception,
  split-chunk, consumed-buffer, noise and back-to-back tests
- Z2: diagnostics use device-reported SOH, no longer import the simulator
  (ModuleStatus in lib/core), dart:math sqrt, absent-cell evidence + confidence
- Y4: hasWriteCapability counts verifiedHardware/verifiedDocument/communitySourced
  write or calibrate claims; approval requires a hardware validation record id
- Y5: revocation sequence persisted (RevocationSequenceStore), equal sequence
  accepted, lower rejected, validUntil enforced
- S7: remove ProfileRegistry.registerExternalProfile (unverified back door)
- tests: repair contribution_platform_test revocation helper (signs the real
  payload), add r4_diagnostics_test and r4_trust_test

Not compiled or run: Dart/Flutter unavailable in this environment.

